{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Walk of Life",
    "steam_appid": 1910150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/c1bc89833ffb8dd29d672bd119ca6644.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/48aadbc80e4866b0e9ed47d668833ab5.poster.avif?t=1754054908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/48aadbc80e4866b0e9ed47d668833ab5.webm?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/48aadbc80e4866b0e9ed47d668833ab5.mp4?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s most accurate life simulator returns in Walk of Life! You\u2019re late for work, rent is overdue, and your refrigerator is literally on fire! Do you have what it takes to remember to eat every week? Dive headfirst into the chaotic rat race and crush your friends in Walk of Life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/269d04a4b0481abceef840591cb1cbeb.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do your best to juggle your health, education, career and personal hygiene, all while dodging the hilarious curveballs life throws your way! Will you be a fry cook, a bank manager, or simply rely on the lottery for your income? Compete against friends or the AI in a series of boardgame-inspired turns to determine who\u2019s the champion in the ultimate game of life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/dadbd1bf9b79ab031e9468fe05238850.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The opulence! The artistry! The swag! Decorate your apartment to flex your material wealth! Nothing screams \u2018success in life\u2019 like a sleek designer couch and a weaponized robot vacuum to protect it from covetous intruders! Leave your friends in awe as you transform your apartment into a veritable Shangri-La of consumer products! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will also be able to express yourself in the literal sense! How multifaceted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/0af6bbb2ec8a867322ec23abf0bda9f3.poster.avif?t=1754054908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/0af6bbb2ec8a867322ec23abf0bda9f3.webm?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2560b37d30dc7c61f9472c45202b4778.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore new ways to approach the game! Take on one of many roles with vastly different playstyles and embark on not-so-epic quests to score some sweet bonus points! Are you going to climb the corporate ladder as the covetous CEO, or scrounge up valuable (and not-so-valuable) treasures as the scavenger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/737258b8d6d36b07dc46891a7b164ba9.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new engine allows for all sorts of new possibilities, including improved visuals, more fluid gameplay and a slew of other modern features. This cutting-edge technology will leave your eyeballs bulging from the excitement overflowing from your brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just take a look the animations on the pawn shop!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/0beb42a6c7436e9c5109d6083af31f1f.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay tuned, change the batteries in your smoke detector, and lower your expectations, because Walk of Life is coming, whether you like it or not! Did you want fries with that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2abafa7bc99a3d01a6f843f72e0b3ad3.poster.avif?t=1754054908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2abafa7bc99a3d01a6f843f72e0b3ad3.webm?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2abafa7bc99a3d01a6f843f72e0b3ad3.mp4?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/c1bc89833ffb8dd29d672bd119ca6644.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/48aadbc80e4866b0e9ed47d668833ab5.poster.avif?t=1754054908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/48aadbc80e4866b0e9ed47d668833ab5.webm?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/48aadbc80e4866b0e9ed47d668833ab5.mp4?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s most accurate life simulator returns in Walk of Life! You\u2019re late for work, rent is overdue, and your refrigerator is literally on fire! Do you have what it takes to remember to eat every week? Dive headfirst into the chaotic rat race and crush your friends in Walk of Life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/269d04a4b0481abceef840591cb1cbeb.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do your best to juggle your health, education, career and personal hygiene, all while dodging the hilarious curveballs life throws your way! Will you be a fry cook, a bank manager, or simply rely on the lottery for your income? Compete against friends or the AI in a series of boardgame-inspired turns to determine who\u2019s the champion in the ultimate game of life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/dadbd1bf9b79ab031e9468fe05238850.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The opulence! The artistry! The swag! Decorate your apartment to flex your material wealth! Nothing screams \u2018success in life\u2019 like a sleek designer couch and a weaponized robot vacuum to protect it from covetous intruders! Leave your friends in awe as you transform your apartment into a veritable Shangri-La of consumer products! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will also be able to express yourself in the literal sense! How multifaceted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/0af6bbb2ec8a867322ec23abf0bda9f3.poster.avif?t=1754054908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/0af6bbb2ec8a867322ec23abf0bda9f3.webm?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2560b37d30dc7c61f9472c45202b4778.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore new ways to approach the game! Take on one of many roles with vastly different playstyles and embark on not-so-epic quests to score some sweet bonus points! Are you going to climb the corporate ladder as the covetous CEO, or scrounge up valuable (and not-so-valuable) treasures as the scavenger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/737258b8d6d36b07dc46891a7b164ba9.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new engine allows for all sorts of new possibilities, including improved visuals, more fluid gameplay and a slew of other modern features. This cutting-edge technology will leave your eyeballs bulging from the excitement overflowing from your brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just take a look the animations on the pawn shop!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/0beb42a6c7436e9c5109d6083af31f1f.avif?t=1754054908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay tuned, change the batteries in your smoke detector, and lower your expectations, because Walk of Life is coming, whether you like it or not! Did you want fries with that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2abafa7bc99a3d01a6f843f72e0b3ad3.poster.avif?t=1754054908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2abafa7bc99a3d01a6f843f72e0b3ad3.webm?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2abafa7bc99a3d01a6f843f72e0b3ad3.mp4?t=1754054908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
